      "type": "raw",
      "html": "<div class=\"ua\"><header class=\"ua-top\"><a class=\"ua-brand wordmark\" href=\"#\">UAdebates</a><nav class=\"ua-nav\"><a href=\"#\">Home</a><a href=\"#\">News</a><a href=\"#\">Calendar</a><a href=\"#\">Clubs</a><a class=\"on\" href=\"#\">About</a></nav><div class=\"ua-right\"><span class=\"ua-lang\"><b>EN</b> | <a href=\"#\">UA</a></span><a class=\"ua-btn ua-btn--line ua-btn--sm\" href=\"#\">Cabinet</a></div></header><main class=\"ua-main\"><div class=\"ua-hist\"><h1 class=\"ua-hist-title\">Debate<br>Federation<br>of Ukraine</h1><div class=\"ua-blobs\"><div class=\"ua-blob b1\"><h2>Mission</h2><p>Developing the intellectual potential of active youth, the foundation of society, through the unique technology of debate</p></div><div class=\"ua-blob b2\"><h2>Goal</h2><p>Building a successful community of well-rounded, informed and socially active young people united by the game of debate</p></div><div class=\"ua-blob b3\"><h2>Means</h2><p>Debate is a game where you can develop the skills of argumentation across a wide range of topics.</p><a href=\"#\">More about debate</a></div></div><div class=\"ua-tl\"><div class=\"ua-tl-year\"><span>2011</span></div><div class=\"ua-tl-item l\"><div class=\"ua-tl-card\"><b>07/05/2011</b><p>First founding conference of the All-Ukrainian youth organisation \"Debate Federation of Ukraine\"</p></div></div><div class=\"ua-tl-year\"><span>2012</span></div><div class=\"ua-tl-item r\"><div class=\"ua-tl-card\"><b>06/2012</b><p>First debate tournament, the Federation Cup in Vinnytsia, for members of the organisation</p></div></div><div class=\"ua-tl-year\"><span>2013</span></div><div class=\"ua-tl-item l\"><div class=\"ua-tl-card\"><b>09-11/05/2013</b><p>First Ukrainian Debate Championship</p></div></div><div class=\"ua-tl-year\"><span>2015</span></div><div class=\"ua-tl-item r\"><div class=\"ua-tl-card\"><b>03/2015</b><p>The number of branches grew to 11 regional and 2 city branches of the DFU</p></div></div><div class=\"ua-tl-item l\"><div class=\"ua-tl-card\"><b>12/2015</b><p>The first English-language debate league was held in Kharkiv</p></div></div></div><div class=\"ua-branches\"><div class=\"ua-branches-h\"><b>Branches</b><span>16 cities. Click a city to see its clubs</span></div><svg class=\"ua-map ua-map--branches\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 440\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Branches of the federation\"><polygon class=\"ua-land\" points=\"11.9,214.2 27.2,178.5 30.6,153.0 61.2,112.2 78.2,86.7 71.4,51.0 88.4,35.7 125.8,34.7 159.8,40.8 204.0,51.0 234.6,58.6 255.0,61.2 285.6,56.1 299.2,66.3 309.4,28.1 340.0,25.5 367.2,15.3 387.6,12.8 418.2,45.9 428.4,68.9 452.2,71.4 462.4,102.0 489.6,112.2 533.8,114.8 550.8,135.1 591.6,142.8 622.2,153.0 622.2,170.9 608.6,193.8 618.8,221.9 612.0,242.2 578.0,242.2 557.6,280.5 533.8,290.7 503.2,298.4 462.4,316.2 442.0,326.4 448.8,351.9 472.6,367.2 499.8,369.8 462.4,397.8 428.4,413.1 397.8,408.0 363.8,367.2 380.8,341.7 404.6,329.0 377.4,331.5 329.8,311.1 302.6,311.1 268.6,367.2 238.0,369.8 217.6,362.1 241.4,316.2 275.4,316.2 282.2,295.8 265.2,270.3 251.6,239.7 217.6,224.4 193.8,211.6 163.2,221.9 108.8,239.7 74.8,237.1 47.6,229.5 27.2,229.5\"/><a class=\"ua-branch\" href=\"#\"><circle cx=\"490.6\" cy=\"133.1\" r=\"5\"/><text x=\"499.6\" y=\"138.1\">Kharkiv</text></a><a class=\"ua-branch\" href=\"#\"><circle cx=\"303.6\" cy=\"312.1\" r=\"5\"/><text x=\"312.6\" y=\"317.1\">Odesa</text></a><a class=\"ua-branch\" href=\"#\"><circle cx=\"296.5\" cy=\"109.6\" r=\"5\"/><text x=\"305.5\" y=\"114.6\">Kyiv</text></a><a class=\"ua-branch\" href=\"#\"><circle cx=\"120.4\" cy=\"94.4\" r=\"5\"/><text x=\"111.4\" y=\"99.4\" text-anchor=\"end\">Lutsk</text></a><a class=\"ua-branch\" href=\"#\"><circle cx=\"322.7\" cy=\"56.6\" r=\"5\"/><text x=\"313.7\" y=\"61.6\" text-anchor=\"end\">Chernihiv</text></a><a class=\"ua-branch\" href=\"#\"><circle cx=\"453.6\" cy=\"242.8\" r=\"5\"/><text x=\"462.6\" y=\"247.8\">Zaporizhzhia</text></a><a class=\"ua-branch\" href=\"#\"><circle cx=\"151.3\" cy=\"101.0\" r=\"5\"/><text x=\"160.3\" y=\"106.0\">Rivne</text></a><a class=\"ua-branch\" href=\"#\"><circle cx=\"226.8\" cy=\"171.9\" r=\"5\"/><text x=\"235.8\" y=\"176.9\">Vinnytsia</text></a><a class=\"ua-branch\" href=\"#\"><circle cx=\"176.5\" cy=\"162.2\" r=\"5\"/><text x=\"167.5\" y=\"167.2\" text-anchor=\"end\">Khmelnytskyi</text></a><a class=\"ua-branch\" href=\"#\"><circle cx=\"160.5\" cy=\"115.8\" r=\"5\"/><text x=\"169.5\" y=\"132.8\">Ostroh</text></a><a class=\"ua-branch\" href=\"#\"><circle cx=\"450.5\" cy=\"211.1\" r=\"5\"/><text x=\"459.5\" y=\"216.1\">Dnipro</text></a><a class=\"ua-branch\" href=\"#\"><circle cx=\"140.8\" cy=\"219.8\" r=\"5\"/><text x=\"149.8\" y=\"224.8\">Chernivtsi</text></a><a class=\"ua-branch\" href=\"#\"><circle cx=\"395.1\" cy=\"180.0\" r=\"5\"/><text x=\"404.1\" y=\"185.0\">Kremenchuk</text></a><a class=\"ua-branch\" href=\"#\"><circle cx=\"394.1\" cy=\"53.6\" r=\"5\"/><text x=\"403.1\" y=\"58.6\">Krolevets</text></a><a class=\"ua-branch\" href=\"#\"><circle cx=\"75.8\" cy=\"140.8\" r=\"5\"/><text x=\"66.8\" y=\"145.8\" text-anchor=\"end\">Lviv</text></a><a class=\"ua-branch\" href=\"#\"><circle cx=\"98.9\" cy=\"187.7\" r=\"5\"/><text x=\"107.9\" y=\"192.7\">Ivano-Frankivsk</text></a></svg></div></div><div class=\"ua-grid2\"><div><div class=\"ua-sec\">Documents</div><div class=\"ua-card ua-docs\"><a href=\"#\"><b>Privacy policy</b><span>What we store and why, served by cab at /policy</span></a><a href=\"#\"><b>Terms of use</b><span>The rules for the site and the cabinet, served by cab at /terms</span></a></div></div><div><div class=\"ua-sec\">Contact</div><div class=\"ua-card ua-pad ua-dl\"><div><span>The federation</span><a href=\"#\">ngo.dfu@uadebate.com</a></div><div><span>Cabinet support</span><a href=\"#\">support@uadebate.com</a></div><div><span>Telegram</span><a href=\"#\">t.me/fdu_ua</a></div></div></div></div></main><footer class=\"ua-foot\"><div class=\"ua-foot-in ua-foot-in--3\"><div><a class=\"wordmark ua-f